WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:04.770
Wow! This is electric.
Let's kick it off!

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:06.972
-Welcome to the...
-...Rock and Roll...

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:08.408
Hall of Fame!

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.043
♪ (ROCK MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:12.946
ROBERT DOWNEY JR.:
What makes for longevity,

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:15.748
consistent quality over time,

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:17.083
and plus, headbands.

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:21.554
Get on your feet
for Duran Duran!

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:25.158
We get to make people
feel better about themselves.

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:26.659
Thank you!

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:29.596
Pat was my hero
and immediate icon.

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:32.232
It has been an incredible ride.

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:36.202
Eminem is the best-selling
hip-hop artist.

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:37.670
EMINEM:
This is crazy. Thank you.

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:41.808
Their sweet dreams were forged
in the furnace of faith.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:43.710
Music is in our souls.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:44.944
We still rock.

00:00:45.044 --> 00:00:47.213
When Lionel shows up,
everyone gets happy.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:51.818
Rock and roll is not a color.
It's a vibe.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:57.289
Carly Simon's range
and sophistication are peerless.

00:00:57.389 --> 00:01:00.226
Judas Priest are
the definitive metal band.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:01.227
ROB HALFORD:
 Everybody's welcome.

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:03.429
That there is what
heavy metal is all about.

00:01:03.929 --> 00:01:04.831
P!NK: Dolly Parton!

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:09.201
DOLLY PARTON:
I figure if I'm gonna be in the
Rock and Roll Hall of Fame...

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:11.738
I'm gonna have to earn it.

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:15.008
I'm a rock star now!

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:18.711
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:23.783
Woo!

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:27.520
That's rock and roll!
Good night, everybody!

